This repository contains official Oikome plugin packages and catalog tooling.
No third-party runtime libraries are bundled into the generated packages.

The RAW Preview package's component (packages/raw-preview/preview.wasm) is
built from sources/raw-preview and includes code generated by and linked
from wit-bindgen (https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wit-bindgen), licensed
under Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception, Apache-2.0 or MIT. sources/componentize
uses wit-component (https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools), under
the same licenses, to build it; none of it is in the package.
